 "brief": "Israeli occupation forces demolished the house of Palestinian prisoner Dwas Hasoun's family in Beit Imrin, northwest of Nablus, on Thursday morning, Shehab Wire reported. The demolition followed the military's entry into the town, closure of roads leading to the residence, and forced evacuation of family members from the building.\n\nThe operation targeted Hasoun, who is accused of carrying out a vehicular attack.",
